note Wrapped copy of seed/omc/tests/struct/t5.om for gate-front-ir: main to uint, ulong or long becomes subject (nom-wrap.sh).
struct C n uint last uint end
fn bump c edit C v uint to void
put c n add get c n v
put c last v
end
fn subject to uint
c = new C 4 4
bump c 3
ret add get c n get c last
end
fn main to int
ret int subject
end
